# API Greenlight — HTTP Requests
# Requiere extensión REST Client en VSCode (humao.rest-client)
# Ejecutar: click en "Send Request" sobre cada bloque
# Base URL Default: http://localhost:4000
# ---

### Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/healthcheck

### Method Not Allowed
POST http://localhost:4000/v1/healthcheck

### createMovieHandler
POST http://localhost:4000/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Breakfast Club",
  "year": 1986,
  "runtime": "96 mins",
  "genres": ["Drama"]
}

### createMovieHandlerError
POST http://localhost:4000/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bloody Sunday 2",
  "year": 2002,
  "runtime": "117 mins",
  "genres": ["Action"]
}

### showMovieHandler
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/movies/4

### updateMovieHandler
PUT http://localhost:4000/v1/movies/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix",
  "year": 1999,
  "runtime": "136 mins",
  "genres": ["Action", "Sci-Fi"]
}

### deleteMovieHandler
DELETE http://localhost:4000/v1/movies/2

### listMoviesHandler
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/movies?genres=Action

### listMoviesHandler
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/movies?genres=Action&page=2&page_size=1


### createUser
POST http://localhost:4000/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "inactive_user",
  "email": "inactive_user@gmail.com",
  "password": "val1234#"
}

### activateUser
PUT http://localhost:4000/v1/users/activated
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "T62DQVKOJHMH62PT5YBXOLCXVE"
}

